      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'One morning, Tynn awoke to a jolt and the sounds of screaming. Her mother
    was not in her bed. When she looked through the crack of the door, she saw her
    mother collapsed on the ground. She ran to her side. The brilliant stones she
    had always seen on her mother''s cloak were gone. In her final moments, her mother
    entrusted the cloak to her daughter and took her last breath.

    Barnik, who
    saw Tynn, immediately took her to his own village. There, he trained her and
    explained the meaning and power of the cloak. After the years she spent with
    Barnik, Tynn had grown. She set out on a journey to both avenge her mother and
    take back the stones.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
